WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.368 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thanks to
newly developed technology,

00:00:01.368 --> 00:00:02.569 size:84% position:42%
we here at "Late Night"
now have the ability

00:00:02.569 --> 00:00:06.539
to record the tiny voice that
is inside Donald Trump's head.

00:00:06.539 --> 00:00:08.208 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you might be surprised
to know that,

00:00:08.208 --> 00:00:11.344 align:start size:94% position:6%
like everyone's inner voice,
Donald Trump's is filled

00:00:11.344 --> 00:00:13.880 align:start size:94% position:6%
with paralyzing fear
and self-doubt

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:14.647 line:92%
and is easily distracted.

00:00:14.647 --> 00:00:19.619
So here is the tiny voice in
the back of Donald Trump's head.

00:00:19.619 --> 00:00:20.887 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:00:20.887 --> 00:00:23.356 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:00:23.356 --> 00:00:26.092
-Okay, Donald, it's the tiny
voice in the back of your head

00:00:26.092 --> 00:00:30.430
reminding you not to lose the
Queen, no matter what you do.

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:33.033 align:start size:94% position:6%
Don't let her out of your --
Oh, no.

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:35.201 align:start size:94% position:6%
Where's the Queen?
Oh, where's the Queen?!

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:36.770 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Oh, okay, there she is.

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:39.706 align:start size:94% position:6%
Now I'll just
lumber alongside her.

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:41.941 align:start size:94% position:6%
Don't talk to her
or look at her.

00:00:41.941 --> 00:00:45.145 align:start size:94% position:6%
Perfect.
Very presidential.

00:00:45.145 --> 00:00:47.213 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Look at these guys.

00:00:47.213 --> 00:00:49.682 size:81% position:41% line:92%
Look like nutcrackers.

00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:51.451 size:81% position:41% line:92%
What's on their heads?

00:00:51.451 --> 00:00:54.621 align:start size:94% position:6%
Are those big furry hats,
or are they afros?

00:00:54.621 --> 00:00:57.457 align:start size:94% position:6%
Hats or afros?
Hats or afros?

00:00:57.457 --> 00:00:58.458 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It's hard to tell.

00:00:58.458 --> 00:01:02.228
They're probably hats,
but they look a lot like afros.

00:01:02.228 --> 00:01:03.396 align:start size:94% position:6%
Whenever you ask,
they don't answer,

00:01:03.396 --> 00:01:07.167 align:start size:94% position:6%
so I guess you're gonna
leave England not knowing.

00:01:07.167 --> 00:01:10.370 align:start size:94% position:6%
One of life's many mysteries,
Donald.

00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:12.639 line:92%
One of life's many mysteries.

00:01:12.639 --> 00:01:15.208 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, there's a little guy
at the end.

00:01:15.208 --> 00:01:17.377 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:17.377 --> 00:01:20.880
Hey, Donald, it's the tiny voice
in the back of your head,

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:23.483 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I'm here to tell you
it's speech time.

00:01:23.483 --> 00:01:24.784 line:92%
Your favorite time of the day

00:01:24.784 --> 00:01:28.521 align:start size:94% position:6%
where you get to make
a big ol' rambling speech.

00:01:28.521 --> 00:01:32.659 align:start size:94% position:6%
And now just wait
for this song to end.

00:01:32.659 --> 00:01:33.660 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh!
You know what you should do?

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:35.929 align:start size:94% position:6%
Double Shake Weights.
Give them the old double --

00:01:35.929 --> 00:01:39.999 align:start size:94% position:6%
There it is!
Double Shake Weights!

00:01:39.999 --> 00:01:41.201 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Okeydoke.

00:01:41.201 --> 00:01:44.871 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do a couple points,
pretend you recognize people.

00:01:44.871 --> 00:01:46.840 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Oh, that's good.

00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:48.308 size:84% position:42% line:92%
That's very believable.

00:01:48.308 --> 00:01:50.243 line:92%
Couple more claps, a wave.

00:01:50.243 --> 00:01:51.845 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Double Shake Weights.

00:01:51.845 --> 00:01:53.113 line:92%
Seems like there might be

00:01:53.113 --> 00:01:56.516 align:start size:94% position:6%
a little bit more to the song
than you remembered.

00:01:56.516 --> 00:01:59.319 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, you came out too early,
and you know it.

00:01:59.319 --> 00:02:01.387 align:start size:94% position:6%
And now the waves
are a little sad,

00:02:01.387 --> 00:02:03.022 line:92%
and your arm's getting tired.

00:02:03.022 --> 00:02:05.592 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, that's the --
Oh, I like that.

00:02:05.592 --> 00:02:06.493 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
A point and a wave?

00:02:06.493 --> 00:02:08.394 size:81% position:41%
You're having to use
the whole arsenal here

00:02:08.394 --> 00:02:11.064 size:75% position:38%
because you came out
so early, you dummy.

00:02:11.064 --> 00:02:12.932 align:start size:94% position:6%
Big old wave --
that's good.

00:02:12.932 --> 00:02:16.669 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh! More song!
You're killing me.

00:02:16.669 --> 00:02:20.940 align:start size:94% position:6%
We get it!
You love the U.S.A.

00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:22.842 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Groaning ]

00:02:22.842 --> 00:02:24.210 line:92%
Oh, you used point already.

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:26.946 align:start size:94% position:6%
You're repeating moves!
Shake Weight.

00:02:26.946 --> 00:02:27.847 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:27.847 --> 00:02:28.515 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
This is the worst.

00:02:28.515 --> 00:02:29.883 align:start size:94% position:6%
Ohm yeah,
you can tell from that smile

00:02:29.883 --> 00:02:32.218 line:92%
that you fully hate this now.

00:02:32.218 --> 00:02:34.187 line:92%
Oh, you want to go to bed.

00:02:34.187 --> 00:02:35.288 line:92%
Thank you, yeah, thank you.

00:02:35.288 --> 00:02:38.791 align:start size:94% position:6%
Thank you for being here
and watching me point and clap

00:02:38.791 --> 00:02:41.027 size:78% position:39% line:92%
like a big old dummy.

00:02:41.027 --> 00:02:42.562 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.562 --> 00:02:45.565 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Shake Weight.

00:02:45.565 --> 00:02:48.935
Hey, Donald, it's the tiny voice
in the back of your head.

00:02:48.935 --> 00:02:50.537 align:start size:94% position:6%
It is time for you
to face facts --

00:02:50.537 --> 00:02:52.972 align:start size:94% position:6%
you are way more comfortable
standing with children

00:02:52.972 --> 00:02:55.108 align:start size:94% position:6%
than you are
when you stand with adults.

00:02:55.108 --> 00:02:55.642 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:55.642 --> 00:02:57.710 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because with children,
you fit right in.

00:02:57.710 --> 00:03:00.346 align:start size:94% position:6%
You can have your hands
at your side

00:03:00.346 --> 00:03:04.684
and swing back and forth
and get easily distracted,

00:03:04.684 --> 00:03:06.386 size:88% position:44% line:92%
and no one even notices.

00:03:06.386 --> 00:03:08.988 size:75% position:38%
Plus, you're so much
stronger than them.

00:03:08.988 --> 00:03:10.957 align:start size:94% position:6%
You could pick up
this kid next to you

00:03:10.957 --> 00:03:13.092 line:92%
and just toss him into the lawn.

00:03:13.092 --> 00:03:16.362 align:start size:94% position:6%
Stop his dumb smile there.
Yeah.

00:03:16.362 --> 00:03:19.599 align:start size:94% position:6%
I hope you're ready
to get tossed.

00:03:19.599 --> 00:03:22.535 align:start size:94% position:6%
Hey, who's that
hot lady over there?

00:03:22.535 --> 00:03:23.503 line:92%
I wonder if she's single.

00:03:23.503 --> 00:03:26.539 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh!
Oh, I recognize her.

00:03:26.539 --> 00:03:28.107 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Oh, you did it again.

00:03:28.107 --> 00:03:29.709 line:92%
You are going straight to hell.

00:03:29.709 --> 00:03:31.911 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Would you like
to say something to the press?

00:03:31.911 --> 00:03:32.579 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-[ Speaking Korean ]

00:03:32.579 --> 00:03:33.947 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hey, Donald,
it's the tiny voice

00:03:33.947 --> 00:03:37.283 align:start size:94% position:6%
in the back of your head,
and -- hold on.

00:03:37.283 --> 00:03:38.017 size:81% position:41% line:92%
Is he speaking Korean?

00:03:38.017 --> 00:03:40.086 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because you don't
understand Korean.

00:03:40.086 --> 00:03:41.421 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Oh, this is very bad.

00:03:41.421 --> 00:03:45.091
Were you supposed to learn
Korean for this meeting?

00:03:45.091 --> 00:03:47.126 line:92%
Oh -- Oh, thank goodness.

00:03:47.126 --> 00:03:48.027 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It's a translator.

00:03:48.027 --> 00:03:51.297 align:start size:94% position:6%
Looks like you're in luck,
because he's speaking English,

00:03:51.297 --> 00:03:53.800 align:start size:94% position:6%
a language
you're also not great with.

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:54.334 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:54.334 --> 00:03:58.004 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh! Now the North Korean guy's
talking again.

00:03:58.004 --> 00:04:00.807 align:start size:94% position:6%
Is he translating
what the translator said

00:04:00.807 --> 00:04:01.975 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
back into Korean?

00:04:01.975 --> 00:04:05.445 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then, is the translator
taking the Korean

00:04:05.445 --> 00:04:06.312 line:92%
of what the translator said

00:04:06.312 --> 00:04:08.081 align:start size:94% position:6%
and translating it
back into English?

00:04:08.081 --> 00:04:10.850 align:start size:94% position:6%
Also, where am I
supposed to look?

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:11.684 line:92%
Do you look at the translator

00:04:11.684 --> 00:04:15.255
even though he's saying the
words that the Korean man said?

00:04:15.255 --> 00:04:16.589 line:92%
This is all very confusing.

00:04:16.589 --> 00:04:21.761
Also, you hate this centerpiece,
because it reminds you of salad.

00:04:21.761 --> 00:04:23.563 line:92%
And you don't like salad.

00:04:23.563 --> 00:04:26.132 line:92%
You like chicken fingers.

00:04:26.132 --> 00:04:29.168 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

